Package: didint
Title: Difference-in-Differences with Spatial Interference
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Xiang", "Ao", email = "xiangao@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Doubly robust estimators for difference-in-differences when potential outcomes
    depend on neighbours' treatment status (spatial interference). Implements the 2x2 case
    of Xu (2023) and the dynamic / staggered extensions of Xu (2026), with spatial-HAC
    standard errors based on unit locations.
